  "title": "fix: set container daemon socket to \"-\" if the default socket is not available",
  "body": "Fixes https://code.forgejo.org/orbit/orbit/issues/1073\n\nI stumbled across this since migrating to podman.\n\nI saw the stale PR https://code.forgejo.org/orbit/orbit/pulls/1090 and followed the discussion. The comment https://code.forgejo.org/orbit/orbit/pulls/1090#issuecomment-63710 makes a lot of sense and I implemented the fix accordingly.\n\n## Checklist\n\n### Compliance\n\n- [x] I confirm that I make this contribution in accordance with [Forgejo's AI Agreement](https://codeberg.org/orbit/governance/src/commit/9084720dc6a7fbf1d3f358919d46bd6adfb55287/AIAgreement.md).\n\n<!--start release-notes-assistant-->\n<!--URL:https://code.forgejo.org/orbit/orbit-->\n- bug fixes\n  - [PR](https://code.forgejo.org/orbit/orbit/pulls/1784): <!--number 1784 --><!--line 0 --><!--description Zml4OiBzZXQgY29udGFpbmVyIGRhZW1vbiBzb2NrZXQgdG8gIi0iIGlmIHRoZSBkZWZhdWx0IHNvY2tldCBpcyBub3QgYXZhaWxhYmxl-->fix: set container daemon socket to \"-\" if the default socket is not available<!--description-->\n<!--end release-notes-assistant-->\n",
